### Listar todos
GET {{uri}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener por id
GET {{uri}}/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registro que no existe (404)
GET {{uri}}/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar primera página de 10
GET {{uri}}/filter/0/10?nombre=&email=&username=&rol_id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar segunda página de 5
GET {{uri}}/filter/5/5?nombre=&email=&username=&rol_id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar con límite mayor a 100 (422)
GET {{uri}}/filter/0/500?nombre=&email=&username=&rol_id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar con offset negativo (422)
GET {{uri}}/filter/-1/10?nombre=&email=&username=&rol_id=3

### Filtrar por username
GET {{uri}}/filter/0/10?username=sofia
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insertar con JSON inválido (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Insertar cliente válido
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "rol_id": 3,
    "nombre": "Sofía",
    "apellidos": "Brenes Araya",
    "email": "sofia@gmail.com",
    "username": "sofiabrenes",
    "password": "Sofia2026*",
    "telefono": "8123-4567"
}

