Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "rol_id": 1,
    "nombre": "Ana",
    "apellidos": "Mora Solís",
    "email": "ana@hotel.com",
    "password": "Clave123*"
}

### Actualizar con un email inválido (400, validación parcial)
PUT {{uri}}/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "email": "no-es-un-email"
}

